# Language Test 202505 - ABC325D: Printing Machine
Sonome kas N tas Kisite kas readint.
Sonome kas jobs tas [].
Sonome kas pair tas [0, 0].
Sonome kas start tas 0.
Sonome kas duration tas 0.
Pilike kas i pas Kisite kas pilika vis N {
    Kemese kas pair tas Kisite kas readints vis 2.
    Kemese kas start tas pair[0].
    Kemese kas duration tas pair[1].
    Putike kas [start, start + duration] tas jobs.
}
Kemese kas jobs tas Kisite kas paline vis jobs.
Sonome kas heap tas [].
Sonome kas index tas 0.
Sonome kas now tas 0.
Sonome kas answer tas 0.
Sonome kas deadline tas 0.
Pilike palusta index < N vista (Kisite kas kipala vis heap) > 0 {
    Palusta (Kisite kas kipala vis heap) kate 0 kasta index < N kasta now < jobs[index][0] {
        Kemese kas now tas jobs[index][0].
    }
    Pilike palusta index < N kasta jobs[index][0] <= now {
        Kisite kas heappush vis heap kasta jobs[index][1].
        index += 1.
    }
    Pilike palusta (Kisite kas kipala vis heap) > 0 kasta (Kisite kas heappeek vis heap) < now {
        Kisite kas heappop vis heap.
    }
    Palusta (Kisite kas kipala vis heap) > 0 {
        Kemese kas deadline tas Kisite kas heappop vis heap.
        answer += 1.
        now += 1.
    }
}
Takute kas answer.
